 primary economic center.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"IR"},{"title":"United States","extract":"The United States of America (USA), also known as the United States (U.S.) or America, is a country primarily located in North America. It is a federal republic consisting of 50 states and a federal capital district, Washington, D.C. The 48 contiguous states border Canada to the north and Mexico to the south, with the semi-exclave of Alaska in the northwest and the archipelago of Hawaii in the Pacific Ocean. The United States also asserts sovereignty over five major island territories and various uninhabited islands in Oceania and the Caribbean. It is a megadiverse country, with the world's fourth-largest total area and third-largest population, exceeding 341 million.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"US"}],"arc":{"reports":402,"first_seen":"2026-10-10T12:53:13Z","first_title":"Here’s a List of Gulf Energy Infrastructure Damaged in Iran War","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxONmpSQUpsbFBZdHJBVzE5RksxTlV3a01Mb0c1bHktX0RSeXhLR3c1bC1JZ3FBUUtWcEYzbkNWZEV1SXQ1QUl2LW1oR0VMa2lvQ0dycm1QMHRWQmpRUjNDOTlqZ2xoU2xkOWZab25sb1R6UW56QWJqb0h0NjRaX3RiOFpCQTc5UzQtRjlMWFBFWG9QazFHQnpHTg?oc=5","first_publisher":"EnergyNow.com","earlier":[{"id":"e_c52ca62ca18a","title":"Iran Oil Exports Near Zero But Peace Deal Not Likely, FGE Says","date":"2026-11-06T05:43:00Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNMkRGUE9vNzFkZTQ5ZWkzZlJtZk5OUlBXSW5ydGJZWXkzMzc1TE1ucTMwUWZrQmVpbUxScWloNGtPNTBsMmtBeTJVRXlPS09lMHN0UDlRYnpHSkZlTFZCRmd1MnNmdzVuTDBQVEVoZWk5WVVRd0RLM1dsRmNBRFJCXzRrR1R2eHJfNGZSYVJEQmRMQ3FFd1NtbEgwRlh1THptV0ExWXlNZURwa3ctQXByR2ZB?oc=5","publisher":"Bloomberg.com","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_bd3de47b9952","title":"Oil Slides Below $100 a Barrel, With Focus on Iran Outlook After U.S. Midter